Package: optix
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Steven Atkinson <steven4x4@gmail.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/steven66619/optix
Depends: libc6, fontconfig
Description: GPU-accelerated terminal emulator
 A GPU-accelerated terminal emulator written in Rust. Uses wgpu for
 rendering, alacritty_terminal for the terminal core, and cosmic-text
 for high-quality font shaping. Features split panes, kitty graphics,
 runtime themes, IPC control, and smooth scrollback browsing.
Version: 0.1.0-1
